{
  "id": "BV1GMtJ62Eo5",
  "title": "陈翔六点半：渴望远方，却困在楼下",
  "guid": "BV1GMtJ62Eo5",
  "pubDate": "2026-09-02",
  "duration": 261,
  "audio": {
    "m4a": "https://storyfm-audio.luanphungba.workers.dev/BV1GMtJ62Eo5.m4a"
  },
  "source": "bilibili",
  "owner": "陈翔六点半",
  "engine": "assemblyai",
  "cues": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "s": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.22,
      "text": "瑟琳娜，你打车了吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "s": 1,
      "start": 1.22,
      "end": 2.59,
      "text": "我刚打了一辆，五分钟到。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "s": 2,
      "start": 2.68,
      "end": 4.24,
      "text": "我也打到了，也是五分钟到。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "s": 3,
      "start": 4.34,
      "end": 6.02,
      "text": "我换个平台呀，再打一辆。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "s": 4,
      "start": 6.32,
      "end": 7.42,
      "text": "你不是刚打了一辆吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "s": 5,
      "start": 7.42,
      "end": 9.06,
      "text": "都在来的路上了，怎么又打？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "s": 6,
      "start": 9.34,
      "end": 10.86,
      "text": "我这不是还没上车吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "s": 7,
      "start": 10.86,
      "end": 13.38,
      "text": "没上车之前我就有选择的权利啊！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "s": 8,
      "start": 13.38,
      "end": 16.02,
      "text": "多打一辆，哪辆车先到我就坐哪辆。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "s": 9,
      "start": 16.02,
      "end": 17.84,
      "text": "总比在一棵树上吊死的强吧？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "s": 10,
      "start": 18.4,
      "end": 19.04,
      "text": "司机已接单。哎，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "s": 11,
      "start": 19.04,
      "end": 20.38,
      "text": "你看，又打到了一辆。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "s": 12,
      "start": 21.83,
      "end": 23.84,
      "text": "哎，还是一辆二十万的车。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "s": 13,
      "start": 23.84,
      "end": 26.2,
      "text": "我刚才打的那辆就是个几万块钱的，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "s": 13,
      "start": 26.2,
      "end": 27.71,
      "text": "哪有这个坐的舒服呀？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "s": 14,
      "start": 28.02,
      "end": 29.98,
      "text": "那你刚刚打的那辆都已经在路上了，怎么办？取消呗。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "s": 15,
      "start": 31.94,
      "end": 33.72,
      "text": "不然留着过年啊！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "s": 16,
      "start": 33.72,
      "end": 34.48,
      "text": "订单已取消。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "s": 17,
      "start": 34.48,
      "end": 36.27,
      "text": "你看，取消了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "s": 18,
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 39.58,
      "text": "喂，我是刚才接你单的司机，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "s": 18,
      "start": 39.58,
      "end": 41.44,
      "text": "我这油钱都烧了多少了？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "s": 19,
      "start": 41.44,
      "end": 42.87,
      "text": "你怎么取消了？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "s": 20,
      "start": 42.88,
      "end": 44.58,
      "text": "师傅，平台规定",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "s": 20,
      "start": 44.58,
      "end": 46.54,
      "text": "没上车之前可以取消的吧？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "s": 21,
      "start": 46.54,
      "end": 47.96,
      "text": "你再接其他乘客不就好了？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "s": 22,
      "start": 48.12,
      "end": 48.94,
      "text": "我还有事，先挂。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "s": 23,
      "start": 48.94,
      "end": 49.48,
      "text": "是。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "s": 24,
      "start": 52.25,
      "end": 55.85,
      "text": "哎，怎么第二辆是一辆五年的宝车呀？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "s": 25,
      "start": 56.56,
      "end": 59.1,
      "text": "五年也还好吧，能坐就行了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "s": 26,
      "start": 59.26,
      "end": 60.5,
      "text": "那能一样吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "s": 27,
      "start": 60.5,
      "end": 61.6,
      "text": "五年的车。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "s": 28,
      "start": 61.66,
      "end": 64.51,
      "text": "你想一下，那座椅都得包浆了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "s": 29,
      "start": 64.58,
      "end": 65.64,
      "text": "算了，我再打一辆吧。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "s": 30,
      "start": 66.4,
      "end": 68.64,
      "text": "你刚打的第二辆车都在来的路上了，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "s": 30,
      "start": 68.64,
      "end": 70.2,
      "text": "有更好的呀就换。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "s": 31,
      "start": 71.92,
      "end": 72.58,
      "text": "司机已接待。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "s": 32,
      "start": 72.58,
      "end": 75.08,
      "text": "哎，你看，我又打到了一辆，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "s": 32,
      "start": 75.32,
      "end": 77.3,
      "text": "还是一辆三十万的车，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "s": 32,
      "start": 77.3,
      "end": 79.32,
      "text": "车龄才一年一分钟就到了，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "s": 33,
      "start": 79.32,
      "end": 81.11,
      "text": "是我运气也太好了吧？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "s": 34,
      "start": 83.91,
      "end": 85.76,
      "text": "不是，怎么取消上一辆",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "s": 34,
      "start": 85.76,
      "end": 87.14,
      "text": "还要扣我三块钱啊？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "s": 35,
      "start": 87.19,
      "end": 89.79,
      "text": "那要不别取消了，也不是很老。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "s": 36,
      "start": 90.93,
      "end": 93.79,
      "text": "三块就三块，总比呀坐五年的老车强。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "s": 37,
      "start": 93.79,
      "end": 97.05,
      "text": "订单已取消，你这都折腾三辆了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "s": 38,
      "start": 97.05,
      "end": 99.12,
      "text": "哎呀，遇到满意的呀就得换。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "s": 39,
      "start": 102.63,
      "end": 104.75,
      "text": "我我刚才没注意看，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "s": 39,
      "start": 104.93,
      "end": 107.17,
      "text": "怎么司机的评分才三点八呀？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "s": 40,
      "start": 107.33,
      "end": 110.51,
      "text": "司机态度极差，一路甩脸色，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "s": 40,
      "start": 110.51,
      "end": 112.43,
      "text": "车里异味重，不讲卫生，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "s": 40,
      "start": 112.43,
      "end": 113.79,
      "text": "明明不是拼车。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "s": 41,
      "start": 114.19,
      "end": 115.93,
      "text": "司机还多接了其他人，不是",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "s": 41,
      "start": 115.93,
      "end": 117.75,
      "text": "这种车谁敢坐呀？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "s": 42,
      "start": 117.75,
      "end": 120.01,
      "text": "算了，还是取消了吧。艾瑟琳娜，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "s": 43,
      "start": 120.01,
      "end": 122.73,
      "text": "现在都那么晚了，雨又这么大，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "u": 42,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "s": 43,
      "start": 122.73,
      "end": 126.84,
      "text": "你再挑，万一找不到怎么办？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "u": 42,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "s": 44,
      "start": 129.35,
      "end": 131.41,
      "text": "哎，怎么可能找不到啊？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "s": 45,
      "start": 131.41,
      "end": 133.33,
      "text": "我就不信了，这么大的城市，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "s": 45,
      "start": 133.33,
      "end": 135.39,
      "text": "我找不到一辆距离近、牌子硬、",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "s": 45,
      "start": 135.39,
      "end": 137.33,
      "text": "车龄新、评分又高的好车。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "s": 46,
      "start": 137.79,
      "end": 139.97,
      "text": "订单已取消，取消了，我再打一辆。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "s": 47,
      "start": 141.46,
      "end": 144.4,
      "text": "怎么回事啊？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "s": 48,
      "start": 145.56,
      "end": 149.82,
      "text": "怎么都需要排队啊？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "s": 49,
      "start": 153.48,
      "end": 155.72,
      "text": "司机已经来，打到了，打到了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "s": 50,
      "start": 155.72,
      "end": 156.09,
      "text": "多久吧？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "s": 51,
      "start": 160.14,
      "end": 163.99,
      "text": "半个小时，还是一辆十年车龄的老款。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "s": 52,
      "start": 164.16,
      "end": 166.66,
      "text": "半个小时，还是老车，老车就老车吧。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "s": 53,
      "start": 166.92,
      "end": 170.48,
      "text": "总比打不着车，回不了家强，凑合坐了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "s": 54,
      "start": 171.23,
      "end": 172.43,
      "text": "嗯。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "s": 55,
      "start": 173.33,
      "end": 173.91,
      "text": "喂，你好。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 70,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 173.91,
      "end": 176.05,
      "text": "姑娘，不好意思啊，离得太远了，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 71,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 176.05,
      "end": 177.22,
      "text": "你把订单取消了吧？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 72,
      "s": 57,
      "start": 177.8,
      "end": 180.16,
      "text": "不是，你个老车，你还挑上我？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 73,
      "s": 58,
      "start": 181.15,
      "end": 181.95,
      "text": "喂！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 74,
      "s": 59,
      "start": 181.95,
      "end": 183.23,
      "text": "哎呀，什么？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 75,
      "s": 60,
      "start": 183.23,
      "end": 184.16,
      "text": "被警告了？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 76,
      "s": 61,
      "start": 184.37,
      "end": 185.64,
      "text": "哎，我再打一辆。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 77,
      "s": 62,
      "start": 187.57,
      "end": 188.02,
      "text": "哼。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 78,
      "s": 63,
      "start": 196.42,
      "end": 202.48,
      "text": "我车到了，那我就先走了，明天见。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 79,
      "s": 64,
      "start": 207.28,
      "end": 216.24,
      "text": "还不走吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 80,
      "s": 65,
      "start": 216.24,
      "end": 217.22,
      "text": "我要关门了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 81,
      "s": 66,
      "start": 217.22,
      "end": 218.84,
      "text": "哎，马上，马上啦！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 82,
      "s": 67,
      "start": 221.86,
      "end": 223.47,
      "text": "喂，师傅您好，哎，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 83,
      "s": 67,
      "start": 223.47,
      "end": 225.35,
      "text": "我是刚才取消您订单的那个乘客。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 84,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 225.89,
      "end": 227.19,
      "text": "师傅是这样的，其实啊，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 85,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 227.19,
      "end": 228.51,
      "text": "我打的第一辆车就是您的，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 86,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 228.51,
      "end": 229.64,
      "text": "要不您来接一下我？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 87,
      "s": 69,
      "start": 230.51,
      "end": 232.71,
      "text": "我给你加钱，我给你加钱行不行？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 88,
      "s": 70,
      "start": 235.29,
      "end": 236.23,
      "text": "不好意思，姑娘，",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 89,
      "s": 70,
      "start": 236.23,
      "end": 238.28,
      "text": "我已经接了别的乘客了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 90,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 250.65,
      "end": 251.81,
      "text": "打不到车，那我走路回家吧。",
